# STAGED — not applied by install.sh (docs/ISOLATION.md).
# KDE Connect talks to the phone on TCP and UDP 1714–1764. Opening these
# on a trusted LAN is enough for pairing; do not expose them to the WAN.
#
# Apply by hand only after you want phone pairing:
#   sudo ufw allow 1714:1764/tcp comment kdeconnect
#   sudo ufw allow 1714:1764/udp comment kdeconnect
#   sudo ufw status
#
# Rollback:
#   sudo ufw delete allow 1714:1764/tcp
#   sudo ufw delete allow 1714:1764/udp
#
# There is no docs/SECURITY.md yet — this comment is the policy record.

# ufw allow 1714:1764/tcp
# ufw allow 1714:1764/udp
